      "widgets_values": [
        "Run once to generate both images in sequence. First: a character guided by pose-arms-down.png. Second: the first image is re-encoded and transformed using pose-arm-raised.png, with denoise = 0.85. OpenPose guides body joints, not identity: the face, clothes and details may change. Higher denoise permits larger posture changes but preserves less of the first image. Guides are already prepared; do not apply Canny or a pose detector to them. SD 1.5 only; not compatible with Z-Image."
